# mutgap3_res_display_doorbell_paused_dies: The display doorbell (0x1220) rung while the device is paused (rvg_device_pause, which pauses every guest display) reaches GuestDisplay::doorbell with no run-state check, whose first act is to assert that the guest display is not paused: the host dies (SIGABRT), on a port whose guest display has no display at all. A guest kills the host with one register write while the hypervisor has it paused.
{"op": "config", "ram": [["0x40000000", "0x4000000"]], "stamp_gpa": "0x40008000", "stamp_slots": 2, "watchdog_s": 30}
{"off": "0x1034", "op": "mmio_w", "val": "0xf5"}
{"off": "0x101c", "op": "mmio_w", "val": "0x10001"}
{"off": "0x1030", "op": "mmio_w", "val": "0x10002"}
{"off": "0x1004", "op": "mmio_w", "val": "0x8000"}
{"off": "0x1010", "op": "mmio_w", "val": "0x400"}
{"off": "0x1000", "op": "mmio_w", "val": "0x1"}
{"gpa": "0x40008400", "hex": "0100000014000000010000000000000004000100", "op": "mem"}
{"off": "0x1008", "op": "mmio_w", "val": "0x14"}
{"ge": "0x1", "gpa": "0x40008000", "label": "stamp 1 on FIFO 0", "op": "wait", "timeout_ms": 5000}
{"label": "a nub without a display", "op": "events"}
{"name": "pause", "op": "api"}
{"label": "paused", "op": "events"}
{"off": "0x1220", "op": "mmio_w", "val": "0x0"}
{"op": "quiesce", "quiet_ms": 100}
{"name": "unpause", "op": "api"}
{"label": "after the doorbell", "op": "events"}
